# Python safepoint interpreter, slice 1 (mechanism + signals)

Slice 1 works on the JVM: interrupt, catch, no-park, fail-closed and 100,000-iteration tail preservation all pass on all four VMs. I could not run the Node (CLJS) or Dart (CLJD) lanes in this headless session, so cross-host acceptance is not verified. Nothing is committed, but one staging slip needs undoing (see Incomplete work).

